{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>ShadowKnot</strong>, every step you take is mirrored by a second self \u2014 your shadow \u2014 moving under inverted gravity. You control both characters simultaneously, connected by a shared energy pool and an invisible bond that limits how far they can drift apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world does not forgive hesitation.<br>Platforms collapse, timing is unforgiving, and your shadow is never just a reflection \u2014 it is a responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong>control, consequence, and coordination</strong>. Progress requires mastering momentum, understanding spatial tension between both characters, and making deliberate choices under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies to defeat \u2014 only environments to survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2608410?t=1769453808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2608410?t=1769453808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608410/be93aa9aa75775ca29df57fa25e3ca45ce54a21e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769453808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608410/be93aa9aa75775ca29df57fa25e3ca45ce54a21e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769453808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>ShadowKnot</strong>, every step you take is mirrored by a second self \u2014 your shadow \u2014 moving under inverted gravity. You control both characters simultaneously, connected by a shared energy pool and an invisible bond that limits how far they can drift apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world does not forgive hesitation.<br>Platforms collapse, timing is unforgiving, and your shadow is never just a reflection \u2014 it is a responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong>control, consequence, and coordination</strong>. Progress requires mastering momentum, understanding spatial tension between both characters, and making deliberate choices under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies to defeat \u2014 only environments to survive.</p>","developers":["Alperen Irez"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608410/83ddf80d68730a7fb88f6bcb9f12f77627ae3c34/header.jpg?t=1769453808","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"RezGame","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2608410/2078078656/a46e4d6026733c2bd3d90a6bda951c3459ddae74/1769332350/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769334201","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2608410/2078078656/a46e4d6026733c2bd3d90a6bda951c3459ddae74/1769332350/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769334201","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2608410/2078078656/a46e4d6026733c2bd3d90a6bda951c3459ddae74/1769332350/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769334201","id":257272373,"name":"Ashes Of The Past","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257272373/835375a1afddfb29d643143558def46e3b252e87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769334201"}],"name":"Ashes Of The Past","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text